'HullFamily feeds RHSData.thetaHull and then RHSData.rhs and theorem110. IsAdmissible enters RHSData; the supplied local hull systems also enter local estimates. These paths use the data conditionally.',
'globalVol feeds LocalEstimate.rhs_le and theorem110. processionVol feeds RHSData.rhs and theorem110. These paths use supplied functions and laws; they do not prove the local numerical estimates.',
'orderNat feeds AdmissiblePrimeData.qOrder, Corollary312VariantData.logQAt, and theorem110. The coprimality predicate enters AdmissiblePrimeData. The decidability instances support predicate elaboration and evaluation; they are not additional paper results.',
'The series feeds a₄ and a₆, which feed tateCurve, tateJ, AdmissiblePrimeData, and theorem110. This is the graph’s coefficient-to-invariant path, not an identification with a paper curve.',
